{"context_through_frame": 111360, "data_kind": "scripted_target_behavior", "example_id": "A001", "messages": [{"audio_id": "U01", "content": "我想先弄清洗衣机的童锁怎么用。它和运行时锁住机门是一回事吗？", "role": "user"}], "response": {"audio_path": "audio/A001.wav", "audio_sha256": "93f96310656e9e102dd9cedfba8fe960f1a108e2e91b893ad281c217cdd52564", "content": "童锁通常限制面板按键，机门锁则防止运行中开门，两者不一定是同一个锁。先告诉我面板上有哪些按键，以及锁图标旁有没有连线或长按秒数。", "frames": 218880, "role": "assistant", "sample_rate": 16000}, "schema": "duplex_v2.consumed_training_example.v1", "user_id": "U01"}
